OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mainly cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain in the morning.
OL,7,FBecoming mostly dry in the afternoon
OL,8,Fwith some bright or sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping and just the odd light
OL,10,Fshower possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will stay mostly dry
OL,13,Fthrough the evening and overnight with
OL,14,Fsome evening sunshine and then clear
OL,15,Fspells, becoming quite chilly in
OL,16,Fsheltered glens. Cloudier in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
