OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FDry with some bright or sunny
OL,6,Fspells in the east. Mostly cloudy with
OL,7,Fthe odd light shower in the west.
OL,8,FChance of more persistent rain in the
OL,9,Fwest late evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FAn
OL,12,Funsettled and changeable period, often
OL,13,Fcloudy with rain or showers, rain
OL,14,Flikely heavy at times in the west.
